Storage keys remain compatible with ResumeBridge / OpenJobAutofill so
existing local profile backups can still be imported.

The bundled job catalog is a 2026-09-06 snapshot compiled from community
campus-recruiting lists (commonly known as 土豆投递表 and 互联派).
It is provided as a convenience, not as an official or continuously
updated dataset. Company names, application URLs, referral flags and
deadlines must be verified on official recruiting pages before applying.

Personal matching notes were removed from the published catalog.
Application progress, resumes and API keys are stored only in the
current browser's extension storage and are not part of this repository.
